AI-interaction-memory/tool-flow/T-20261009-003__workspace-migration.json:143:      "input": "text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: E:/Codex_project/AMD_Sonofield/.migration-private/prepare_candidate.py\\n+\\\"\\\"\\\"One-time migration preparation. Run only after the unmodified BASE gate passes.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n+import datetime, hashlib, json, os, pathlib, re, shutil, subprocess\\n+\\n+R=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\\n+P=R/'.migration-private'\\n+AUD=P/'phase0'\\n+BASE='ecd32e76e9b6c08806eae30a3c75a9c3be5e7570'\\n+BRANCH='chore/v5-ax7020-workspace-isolation'\\n+STAMP='20261009'\\n+NOW=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone(datetime.timedelta(hours=8))).isoformat()\\n+E=R/'v5/evidence/migration'/STAMP\\n+M=R/'shared/migration'\\n+\\n+def git(*args):return subprocess.check_output(['git','-C',str(R),*args])\\n+def h(b):return hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest()\\n+def put(rel,text):\\n+ p=R/rel;p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);p.write_text(text.rstrip()+'\\\\n',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\\\n')\\n+def js(rel,obj):put(rel,json.dumps(obj,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))\\n+\\n+assert R==pathlib.Path(r'E:\\\\Codex_project\\\\AMD_Sonofield')\\n+assert git('remote','get-url','origin').decode().strip()=='https://github.com/loverlike1216/SonoField-FPGA.git'\\n+assert git('branch','--show-current').decode().strip()==BRANCH\\n+assert git('rev-parse','HEAD').decode().strip()==BASE\\n+assert git('ls-remote','origin','refs/heads/main').decode().split()[0]==BASE\\n+baseline=json.loads((E/'base/summary.json').read_text())\\n+assert baseline['status']=='PASS' and baseline['python_tests']==115 and baseline['frame_count']==3696\\n+assert baseline['determinism']['runs']==4\\n+previous=json.loads((R/'v5/evidence/baseline/board_integration_20261009/summary.json').read_text())\\n+assert baseline['determinism']['hashes']==previous['determinism']['hashes']\\n+assert 'V5_OOC_SYNTHESIS_COMPLETE' in (P/'phase1_vivado_console.log').read_text(errors='replace')\\n+\\n+# Retain fresh BASE evidence before restoring fixed-path historical reports.\\n+shutil.copytree(R/'v5/evidence/core_timing_real_loop/timing_refactor',E/'base/equivalence')\\n+shutil.copytree(R/'v5/evidence/synthesis',E/'base/ooc')\\n+shutil.copyfile(P/'phase1_vivado_console.log',E/'base/ooc/synthesis_console.log')\\n+shutil.copyfile(P/'phase1_baseline_console.log',E/'base/console.log')\\n+shutil.copyfile(P/'dependency_install.log',E/'base/dependency_install.log')\\n+\\n+manifest=json.loads((AUD/'OLD_TRACKED_MANIFEST.json').read_text())\\n+assert manifest['base_commit']==BASE and manifest['files_count']==3907\\n+original_state=json.loads((R/'shared/PROJECT_STATE.json').read_text())\\n+original_versions=json.loads((R/'shared/VERSION_STATE.json').read_text())\\n+original_decisions=(R/'shared/DECISIONS.md').read_text()\\n+original_attributes=(R/'.gitattributes').read_text()\\n+old_instruction_paths=[\\n+ 'AI-interaction-memory/codex/instructions/ax7020_v5_safe_organization.md',\\n+ 'AI-interaction-memory/codex/instructions/ax7020_v5_board_bom_integration.md',\\n+ 'AI-interaction-memory/codex/instructions/v2_self_calibration.md',\\n+ 'AI-interaction-memory/codex/instructions/v2_formal_development.md',\\n+ 'AI-interaction-memory/codex/instructions/codex_engineering_rules_20261003.md',\\n+]\\n+keep=set(old_instruction_paths)|{\\n+ 'AI-problem/problem/P-20261008-001__adc-40khz-bandwidth.md',\\n+ 'AI-problem/problem/P-20261009-001__ax7020-revision-ps-platform.md',\\n+ 'AI-chat-memory/SonoField-FPGA.md','AI-chat-memory/CHAT_MEMORY_IMPORT_REQUIRED.md',\\n+}\\n+archive=R/'history_old';assert not archive.exists();archive.mkdir()\\n+proc=subprocess.Popen(['git','-C',str(R),'cat-file','--batch'],stdin=subprocess.PIPE,stdout=subprocess.PIPE)\\n+for row in manifest['files']:\\n+ rel=row['path'];dest=archive/rel\\n+ assert dest.resolve().is_relative_to(archive.resolve())\\n+ proc.stdin.write((row['git_blob_sha']+'\\\\n').encode());proc.stdin.flush()\\n+ header=proc.stdout.readline().split();data=proc.stdout.read(int(header[2]));assert proc.stdout.read(1)==b'\\\\n'\\n+ assert h(data)==row['sha256']\\n+ dest.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);dest.write_bytes(data)\\n+ source=R/rel\\n+ if rel.startswith('v5/'):\\n+  # No source adaptation occurs before this restoration. Fresh outputs have new paths.\\n+  source.write_bytes(data)\\n+ elif rel not in keep:\\n+  assert source.resolve().is_relative_to(R) and not source.resolve().is_relative_to(P)\\n+  source.unlink()\\n+proc.stdin.close();assert proc.wait()==0\\n+# Only empty old directories are removed; private/generated paths are never traversed.\\n+old_dirs=sorted({(R/x['path']).parent for x in manifest['files'] if not x['path'].startswith('v5/')},key=lambda p:len(p.parts),reverse=True)\\n+for d in old_dirs:\\n+ while d!=R and d.exists():\\n+  try:d.rmdir()\\n+  except OSError:break\\n+  d=d.parent\\n+\\n+js('shared/migration/OLD_TRACKED_MANIFEST.json',manifest)\\n+public=json.loads((AUD/'PRE_MIGRATION_AUDIT.json').read_text())\\n+public.pop('local_status');public['private_inventory_path']='.migration-private/phase0 (LOCAL ONLY)'\\n+public.update(new_workspace=str(R),workspace_approval='CANDIDATE_PATH_PENDING_USER_RESPONSE',old_workspace_protection='ALL_EXISTING_TRACKED_UNTRACKED_IGNORED_RAW_SHA256_AND_GIT_METADATA_INVENTORIED',gate_0='PASS',gate_1='PASS')\\n+js('shared/migration/PRE_MIGRATION_AUDIT.json',public)\\n+put('shared/migration/PRE_MIGRATION_AUDIT.md',f'''# Pre-migration audit\\n+\\n+PROJECT_ID SONOFIELD_FPGA; v5 unchanged; BASE_COMMIT `{BASE}`; same public repository.\\n+Old local main and remote main matched. Candidate branch `{BRANCH}` is an independent network clone (no alternates/worktree/shared Git directory).\\n+Candidate path `{R}` was empty, is separate from the old physical sandbox and has no junction/symlink. Suggested alternative path was absent. Permanent workspace promotion awaits the user's path confirmation and reviewed main merge.\\n+\\n+Git BASE: 3907 regular files, 97,559,165 blob bytes, mode100644 throughout. No case collisions, LFS pointers, submodules, symlinks or recognized credential signatures. Exact blob SHA/size/SHA256/path inventory is OLD_TRACKED_MANIFEST.json.\\n+Old local: 3906 existing tracked files, one pre-existing deleted `BOM/README.md`, 35 nonignored untracked files and 30068 existing ignored files; all existing file bytes were hashed. Ten additional ignored ls-files entries were already absent. The full sensitive path/hash inventory and Git metadata inventory are PRIVATE LOCAL ONLY under `.migration-private/phase0/`; they are not part of the public commit.\\n+\\n+The old Git tree snapshot intentionally includes the committed BOM/README.md; this does not resurrect that file in the old local directory. Paused local v3, PCB backup, BOM draft, the user-supplied handoff and private raw evidence stay in the old directory. No local file is silently substituted into BASE. The handoff is imported separately with explicit local provenance.\\n+Protection: never write/pull/reset/clean the old sandbox. Keep both the original and private inventory; user-controlled offline backup remains recommended. A final full rehash will compare every inventoried file and Git metadata. Free E: space at preflight was {public['e_drive_free']:,} bytes; source/venv/builds fit with substantial headroom.\\n+\\n+Gate0 PASS; Gate1 PASS: fresh locked Python3.10/Tk, 115 tests, 3696 frames ×3 Icarus +1 XSim and all C/AXI/waveform/calibration/safety/equivalence gates. Canonical traces match the preceding BASE evidence exactly. Native Vivado2025.2 OOC was rebuilt from this clone. This is not full-board timing or hardware functional verification.\\n+''')\\n+\\n+put('history_old/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md',f'''# Frozen old repository tree\\n+\\n+BASE_COMMIT: `{BASE}`. Archived: {NOW}. Snapshot: 3907 files / 97,559,165 raw blob bytes.\\n+Every original tracked path maps to history_old/<original-path>, including old v5 and all dotfiles. .git is repository metadata and was never included. Freeze manifest records the original blob SHA, mode, raw SHA256 and tree manifest hash.\\n+\\n+This is HISTORICAL_READ_ONLY. Default search, IDE indexing, test discovery, Python imports, Tcl filesets and delivery packaging exclude this directory. This migration audit may inspect it; subsequent work requires an explicit user instruction naming history/recovery. Nested AGENTS.md/configurations describe historical scope only.\\n+\\n+Recover an individual original with git show {BASE}:<original-path>. For complete rollback use a reviewed revert commit, never force push or a history rewrite. The untouched original physical sandbox remains the local recovery source for untracked/private assets, which are not this archive's contents.\\n+\\n+Third-party/license declarations retain their original bytes and scope. Archiving does not grant new redistribution rights. No new license is invented; unresolved delivery rights remain a release review item. Routine CI verifies Git object identity without loading historical source.\\n+''')\\n+js('history_old/FREEZE_MANIFEST.json',{**manifest,'frozen_at':NOW,'status':'FROZEN','access_rule':'USER_EXPLICIT_HISTORY_OR_CURRENT_MIGRATION_AUDIT_ONLY','original_tree':git('rev-parse',BASE+'^{tree}').decode().strip(),'metadata_files':['ARCHIVE_INDEX.md','FREEZE_MANIFEST.json']})\\n+js('shared/migration/ARCHIVE_COVERAGE.json',{'status':'PASS_RAW_SHA256_PENDING_INDEX_BLOB_CHECK','base_commit':BASE,'files':[{**x,'status':'PASS_RAW_SHA256'} for x in manifest['files']],'files_count':len(manifest['files']),'bytes':manifest['bytes'],'exceptions':[]})\\n+js('shared/migration/ARCHIVE_METADATA_HASHES.json',{'files':{p.name:h(p.read_bytes()) for p in [archive/'ARCHIVE_INDEX.md',archive/'FREEZE_MANIFEST.json']}})\\n+\\n+# Root attributes explicitly disable filters for archived blobs, including original CRLF.\\n+put('.gitattributes',original_attributes+'''\\\\n# Exact frozen Git blob bytes; no CRLF normalization or filters in the archive.\\n+history_old/** -text -filter -ident -whitespace\\n+''')\\n+put('.gitignore','''/.venv/\\n+/.migration-private/\\n+/.portability/\\n+__pycache__/\\n+*.pyc\\n+build/\\n+tmp/\\n+.Xil/\\n+*.jou\\n+*.wdb\\n+*.vcd\\n+*.xpr\\n+*.cache/\\n+*.runs/\\n+*.sim/\\n+*.hw/\\n+*.ip_user_files/\\n+vivado_pid*.str\\n+dfx_runtime.txt\\n+v5/**/local_raw/\\n+v5/hardware/bom/working/2026-10-09/preview/\\n+v5/evidence/**/gui_*/rtl/\\n+v5/evidence/**/gui_*/trajectory_*.json\\n+v5/evidence/**/gui_*/*_motion_ack.txt\\n+v5/evidence/**/faults/*.vvp\\n+v5/evidence/**/faults/xsim.dir/\\n+v5/evidence/**/faults/xsim*.log\\n+v5/evidence/**/faults/xelab*.log\\n+''')\\n+put('.ignore','''history_old/**\\n+.migration-private/**\\n+.portability/**\\n+.venv/**\\n+**/build/**\\n+**/__pycache__/**\\n+**/.Xil/**\\n+**/xsim.dir/**\\n+**/local_raw/**\\n+''')\\n+js('.vscode/settings.json',{'files.exclude':{'history_old':True,'.migration-private':True,'.portability':True},'search.exclude':{'history_old/**':True,'**/build/**':True,'**/local_raw/**':True},'files.watcherExclude':{'**/history_old/**':True,'**/build/**':True},'python.analysis.exclude':['history_old','.portability','.migration-private']})\\n+\\n+put('AGENTS.md','''# SonoField-FPGA current engineering scope\\n+\\n+PROJECT_ID SONOFIELD_FPGA; same https://github.com/loverlike1216/SonoField-FPGA.git; sole active version v5; ALINX AX7020; Vivado/Vitis2025.2. This change is workspace migration, never a version upgrade. No v4/v6. The original physical sandbox must remain untouched, including dirty/untracked/private assets.\\n+\\n+Recovery: README -> shared/PROJECT_STATE.* -> VERSION_STATE.json -> CONTEXT_CHECKPOINT.* -> CURRENT_PLAN -> DECISIONS -> BLOCKERS/ACCEPTANCE -> current evidence and current open AI-problem -> Git status/HEAD/remote. Verify candidate versus approved/main state before action. Do not claim the candidate is merged.\\n+\\n+CURRENT_SCOPE = v5/ + shared/ + current AI-problem/ + current AI indexes + root docs and integration configuration. history_old/ is FROZEN and excluded from default reads/search/build/test/import/packaging/IDE. Only this migration audit or a later explicit user history/recovery instruction may read its contents. Nested old AGENTS/configurations are historical, not current instructions. Never fall back to old versions or old physical workspaces. Use exact v5 source lists or v5-rooted discovery, never repository-wide RTL globbing.\\n+\\n+Keep128TX/8RX,8bit requested/calibration separation, common timebase,32lanes×4used, atomic complete-map commit, safety/error behavior, signed capture/ACK, protocol/registers,50Hz motion cadence, radiating-face12mm pitch/100mm nominal90–115mm gap and geometric-center origin. Preserve all tests/goldens/thresholds including35dB calibration acceptance. Ordinary path/output fixes are allowed; architecture/ADC/platform changes need their actual decision and user approval boundary. Continue means continue v5.\\n+\\n+Only AX7020 is current hardware. Board revision AX701020.3.0/XC7Z020/CLG400 has historical read-only identification evidence; complete grade/VCCO/PS DDR/clock/UART/BSP/production IO/external timing remain unqualified.132MHz is an internal design target; OOC synthesis is not route or hardware proof. Do not import Robei/EBAZ pins, old COM/clock/DDR defaults. Formal ADC is AD7606BBSTZ-RL; C-16 is a candidate pending independent review and user approval. TX is NU40C10T; RX MPN UNKNOWN. Each64TX array has its own external power input/protection/default-off cutoff; AX7020 supplies control/data only. Native v5 schematic NOT_CREATED; ERC_NOT_RUN; MANUFACTURING_HOLD.\\n+\\n+No board programming/reset/init/CPU halt/unknown GPIO/DDR RAM/boot/SD/Flash/driver/PCB operations are authorized by migration. Distinguish TESTED/SIMULATED/SYNTHESIZED_OOC/ROUTED/HARDWARE_READONLY/NOT_VERIFIED. Preserve failure logs. Use PowerShell7. All venv/build/output belongs under the new clone; inspect actual tool paths. Complete baseline requires115 tests and3696frames×3Icarus+1XSim plus existing C/AXI/calibration/safety/equivalence. No skip/threshold relaxation/mock hardware claims.\\n+\\n+No force push/rebase history/orphan/reset--hard/blanket clean. Stage only reviewed files; public repository requires secret/privacy scan and excludes local_raw/private inventory. Candidate commits/push/Draft PR are authorized; merging main requires explicit user approval of the concrete candidate. History snapshot must remain byte/blob/mode-identical; routine CI checks metadata without reading old source. No subagents requested.\\n+\\n+Persist actual observable prompts/messages/tool flows with hashes and PARTIAL boundaries in AI-interaction-memory; do not record hidden reasoning or invent ChatGPT outputs. External ChatGPT reader is BLOCKED. Major decisions use AI-problem with ID/body-hash/version verification; ordinary bugs close locally. Reconcile state/evidence and checkpoint at real milestones; no model self-certification of final hardware acceptance.\\n+''')\\n+put('README.md','''# SonoField-FPGA — AX7020 v5\\n+\\n+PROJECT_ID **SONOFIELD_FPGA** · **v5 ACTIVE** · **ALINX AX7020** · Vivado2025.2. This is a candidate workspace migration in the existing repository. Main merge and permanent workspace promotion require user review. No version upgrade.\\n+\\n+Start with [current state](shared/PROJECT_STATE.json), [recovery checkpoint](shared/CONTEXT_CHECKPOINT.md), [runbook](shared/migration/RUNBOOK.md), [migration evidence](shared/migration/PORTABILITY_AND_REGRESSION.md), [acceptance](shared/ACCEPTANCE.md) and [rollback](shared/migration/ROLLBACK_PLAN.md). The sole production implementation is [v5](v5/README.md). Build/tests/imports use v5 only. Frozen history is excluded from everyday work and may be inspected only on explicit history/recovery instructions.\\n+\\n+128TX/8RX, opposed8×8 arrays,8bit independent requested/calibration phases, atomic maps, common timebase,32lanes×4used,50Hz motion infrastructure and existing PS/C/AXI interfaces are preserved. TX NU40C10T; RX MPN unknown; formal ADC AD7606BBSTZ-RL. C-16 is an unapproved candidate. Geometry is12mm radiating-face pitch,100mm nominal face gap adjustable90–115mm, geometric-center origin. Upper/lower64TX arrays have independent external power/protection/cutoff; AX7020 handles signals only.\\n+\\n+Real digital regression and documented-device OOC evidence are separate from physical acceptance. Historical AX701020.3.0/XC7Z020/CLG400 read-only identification does not prove PS-PL/DDR/UART/ADC/driver/acoustic operation. Whole-platform conclusion remains REVISE; native v5 schematic NOT_CREATED, ERC_NOT_RUN, electrical/manufacturing HOLD.50mg EPS is a future measured milestone. ChatGPT history access BLOCKED; observable current Codex records PARTIAL.\\n+''')\\n+put('CHANGELOG.md',f'''# Current change log\\n+\\n+## 2026-10-09 — v5 candidate workspace migration\\n+\\n+Independent clone at `{R}`, BASE `{BASE}`. All3907tracked old-tree files preserved under history_old with rawSHA256/blob/mode proof. Old physical sandbox and private assets untouched. Current v5 extracted without core/interface/golden/test changes. Current state/blocked hardware authority reconciled; safe isolated evidence paths and metadata-only archive protection added. Fresh BASE, migrated and clean-clone outcomes are in migration evidence; main merge remains pending. Prior change log is frozen historical provenance, not today's current state.\\n+''')\\n+put('shared/migration/EXECUTION_CONTRACT.md','''# Goal\\n+Isolate AX7020-only v5 in an independent clone and preserve the fixed old Git tree in history_old.\\n+\\n+# Scope\\n+Phase0–7 audits, independent environments, archive mapping, current state/root cleanup, safe output/path parameters, regression/OOC/reopen, candidate commits and Draft PR.\\n+\\n+# Non-Goals\\n+No new version, core redesign, formal ADC substitution, board operations, new PCB/manufacturing or main merge.\\n+\\n+# Constraints / Invariants\\n+Original sandbox is immutable. Preserve protocol/registers/phase/geometry/safety/motion/128TX/8RX and all acceptance criteria. No skipped tests or changed goldens. Archive is exact BASE blob/mode/raw-byte copy. Public material must exclude private raw/credentials.\\n+\\n+# Architecture / Allowed Changes\\n+Keep v5's existing production modules; add only explicit output/work parameters and isolation/metadata checks. Current root contains current documentation/AI scope and v5. Tool installations are host facts, not board facts.\\n+\\n+# Inputs / Dependencies\\n+User Phase0–7 instruction, local read-only handoff, fixed BASE Git tree, actual Python3.10/Tk/Icarus/GCC/Vivado2025.2. No unsupported chat API.\\n+\\n+# Validation / Evidence Required\\n+All MIG01–12;115Python,3696frames×4, C/AXI/safety/calibration/equivalence, native OOC/reopen/source list, exact archive hashes/modes, original rehash, second clean clone with its own locked venv. Preserve failed evidence.\\n+\\n+# Rollback\\n+Candidate failure leaves main and original sandbox unchanged. Future approved revert commit restores pre-migration tree; never rewrite history.\\n+\\n+# Done When\\n+Candidate regression and integrity gates pass, evidence/risk/rollback/checkpoint are reviewable and Draft PR is submitted. Formal main switch awaits explicit user approval; post-merge remote fresh clone is deferred until that approval.\\n+''')\\n+put('shared/migration/ROLLBACK_PLAN.md',f'''# Rollback plan\\n+\\n+Recovery SHA: `{BASE}`. Same repository, original Git history preserved. Original physical sandbox `E:\\\\\\\\Codex_project\\\\\\\\AMD-SonoField-FPGA` remains exactly as found, including pre-existing deletion, untracked v3/PCB/BOM/handoff and ignored raw data. Private inventories are local only.\\n+\\n+Before merge: leave main unchanged, retain candidate branch and failure logs. To recover a clean original source copy, independently `git clone https://github.com/loverlike1216/SonoField-FPGA.git <new-empty-directory>`, then `git switch --detach {BASE}` there. Never reset/pull/clean the original sandbox.\\n+\\n+One file can be read with `git show {BASE}:<original-path>`; restore to a new review destination, without overwriting the original. The archive manifest maps every original path to history_old/<path> and records rawSHA256/blob/mode.\\n+\\n+After an approved merge, a regression requires a newly reviewed revert commit. For a two-parent merge: `git revert -m 1 <verified-merge-SHA>` on a new rollback branch; for squash/single-parent commits, revert the verified migration commit(s) in reverse order. Review the resulting tree/diff, rerun core gates and submit a rollback PR. These are conditional instructions, not actions executed in this migration. Scope/merge approval is required. No force push, orphan branch, reset--hard or history rewrite.\\n+\\n+Remote main changing during preparation invalidates the frozen comparison until a fresh reconciliation; never overwrite parallel commits. Missing archived objects, mismatched hashes or failures block merge. Device/boot rollback is unnecessary because migration performs no hardware operations.\\n+''')\\n+put('shared/migration/DELIVERY_MANIFEST.md','''# Candidate delivery boundary\\n+\\n+Include current README/AGENTS/CHANGELOG, current shared state/acceptance/runbook/migration reports, current open Problems and actual observable AI provenance, v5 source/config/firmware/testbench/golden fixtures/locked dependencies/tool scripts, current hardware proposals with unapproved status and selected real summaries/logs/canonical traces. Preserve original submitted BOM and distinguish the working candidate. No license is invented; third-party rights require review before external competition/release distribution.\\n+\\n+Exclude history_old, .git, .venv, .migration-private, .portability, build/cache/Xil/simulator binaries/raw traces, local_raw, private vendor documents/device identity, BOM preview caches and unapproved fabrication/layout/Gerber artifacts. Include candidate design notes only when clearly marked NOT_RELEASED. Native v5 schematic/qualified netlist and ERC do not exist and cannot be included as completed assets.\\n+\\n+Future package_submission should use an explicit Git-tracked allowlist, fixed candidate commit and deterministic sorted manifest of relative path/size/SHA256; normalize zip entry timestamps and verify unpacked hashes in a separate directory. It must fail if any forbidden/private/history path is selected. This task defines the boundary and does not manufacture or publish a final competition/hardware package.\\n+''')\\n+\\n+# Original approved decisions remain byte-identical in the archive. Extract current entries verbatim.\\n+current_decisions=original_decisions[original_decisions.index('## ADR-035'):]\\n+put('shared/DECISIONS.md','# Current adopted decisions\\\\n\\\\nEarlier core decisions remain valid in their original interface scope; historical board choices do not transfer to AX7020. Original decision bytes are preserved in the fixed BASE archive.\\\\n\\\\n'+current_decisions+f'''\\\\n\\n+## ADR-037 — User-authorized v5 workspace migration (2026-10-09)\\n+\\n+Type: WORKSPACE_MIGRATION_AUTHORIZED; version v5 unchanged. Source: actual current user instruction plus Phase0–7 document in AI-interaction-memory/codex/instructions/v5_workspace_migration_20261009.md. Preserve original physical sandbox, clone independently, archive fixed Git tracked tree, maintain AX7020-only current implementation and all inherited acceptance. Candidate commits/push/Draft PR authorized. USER_APPROVAL_REQUIRED_FOR_MAIN_MERGE. This is not a ChatGPT Decision or version approval. Candidate workspace `{R}`; permanent path promotion pending user confirmation and successful reviewed merge. BASE `{BASE}`.\\n+''')\\n+put('shared/BLOCKERS.md','''# Current v5 blockers — 2026-10-09\\n+\\n+Only this table is the current blocker authority. Earlier v2/Robei narratives are historical and do not close AX7020 gates. Last verified from repository evidence and this migration:2026-10-09.\\n+\\n+| ID | Status / evidence | Owner / next action | Scope |\\n+|---|---|---|---|\\n+| V5-B01 | PARTIALLY_RESOLVED: AX701020.3.0/XC7Z020/CLG400 historical read-only evidence; full grade/VCCO/Rev3 clock/connector match unknown. v5/evidence/board_bringup/20261009/RESULT.md | User/manufacturer: revision-matched facts | Physical |\\n+| V5-B03 | OPEN: running-image ownership, matched PS DDR/preset/XSA/BSP, UART and real PS-PL absent. P-20261009-001 | User/embedded: obtain matched platform and safe ownership; no DDR RAM or board operation during migration | Physical |\\n+| V5-B04 | OPEN: external66MHz min/max/fanout/cable/PVT, ADC/AFE, watchdog/default-off/rearm/surge/thermal. v5/hardware/integration_candidates/20261009/SAFETY_AND_POWER.md | Hardware/reviewer: measured qualification | Electrical |\\n+| V5-B05 | OPEN: NU40C10T batch/continuous drive/phase/amplitude, exact RX MPN, physical trap/particle milestones missing | User/experimental: datasheets/samples and staged measurements | Acoustic |\\n+| V5-BOM_REVIEW | OPEN/HOLD: formal AD7606B bandwidth; C-16 remains unapproved, surge/MPN/native pin-level netlist unresolved. P-20261008-001; v5/hardware/bom/working/2026-10-09/ | Independent reviewer/user: decisions then verification | Electrical |\\n+| NATIVE_SCHEMATIC_ENVIRONMENT | NOT_CREATED / ERC_NOT_RUN / MANUFACTURING_HOLD | CAD owner after board/electrical facts; old PCB/V1 is not a v5 production design | Hardware |\\n+| CHAT_MEMORY_ACCESS_BLOCKED | BLOCKED: no exposed supported external ChatGPT history reader, ID/URL UNKNOWN | User: supported export or connector if needed | Provenance |\\n+| INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING | OPEN: no external AI/independent human review fabricated; A+B real environments and two simulators are available evidence | User/reviewer: review concrete Draft PR and evidence | Final review |\\n+| MIG-MAIN | PENDING: explicit user approval for main merge and then post-merge fresh remote clone | User/Codex after approval | Migration promotion |\\n+\\n+Physical blockers do not prevent digital migration validation. Whole-platform REVISE; candidate scope evaluated separately. No second active BLOCKERS_ENGINEERING table is created.\\n+''')\\n+put('shared/migration/HARDWARE_CONFLICT_DISPOSITION.md','''# Hardware/source conflict disposition\\n+\\n+| Source | Purpose | Valid scope | Decision/status |\\n+|---|---|---|---|\\n+| v5/config/hardware_parts.json TCT40 TX/RX | Preserved inherited digital fixture | Historical/simulation component assumptions; no purchasing authority | Byte-identical; current TX is NU40C10T and actual RX MPN UNKNOWN |\\n+| v5/config/acoustic_baseline.json / visualize_field.py TCT40 approximation | Preserved numerical model/reference | Synthetic directional approximation; no measured NU40 parameters | Do not rename parameters or change golden behavior to imply measured equivalence |\\n+| v5/hardware/integration_candidates/20261009/current_hardware_scope.json | Current hardware scope | AX7020 + NU40 + three boards + independent upper/lower power | Authoritative design input, unqualified electrical implementation |\\n+| Formal AD7606BBSTZ-RL vs working BOM C-16 | Production versus recommendation | AD7606B remains formal; C-16 only isolated candidate | P-20261008-001 OPEN; independent review + user approval required |\\n+| ALINX V2.0 schematic/XSA vs actual AX701020.3.0 | Vendor reference versus observed revision | Candidate preset/pin/DDR only | P-20261009-001 OPEN; no PS init/unknown RAM access |\\n+| Previous shared v2 blockers/ENGINEERING_STATE | Old hardware stage | HISTORICAL_READ_ONLY | Current state rebuilt as v5; historical decisions retained verbatim |\\n+| board_clock_candidate.sv low-level old defaults | Inherited unused candidate | Not included in OOC production source list, not AX7020 clock fact |132MHz internal target preserved; physical clocks remain unqualified |\\n+\\n+The 128TX/8RX/32×4 architecture, formal ADC, protocol/registers/calibration/motion/safety/goldens and acceptance are unchanged. No new formal Problem is necessary for path organization: the two current hardware Problems already cover the substantive pending decisions.\\n+''')\\n+put('AI-problem/INDEX.md','''# Current v5 problems\\n+\\n+| ID | Record | State | Canonical body SHA256 |\\n+|---|---|---|---|\\n+| P-20261008-001 | [ADC bandwidth](problem/P-20261008-001__adc-40khz-bandwidth.md) | OPEN / no imported decision |231aa1770662448c8e9f9cd83aa1b309abcbc21790ffd26eb58821ffe33843ab |\\n+| P-20261009-001 | [Rev3 PS platform](problem/P-20261009-001__ax7020-revision-ps-platform.md) | OPEN / no imported decision |e57cb33e5aee67620a115d901196df28d33574756f4029bfbbe03b04e66a40e4 |\\n+\\n+Both original files remain unchanged, at the same active relative paths; the complete old problem/decision tree is frozen history. No earlier board Decision becomes current AX7020 authority. Canonical body policy: LF UTF-8 text.split(\\\"---\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n\\\",1)[1], excluding front matter and its following blank separator. Verify ID/body hash/version before executing any future decision.\\n+''')\\n+put('AI-chat-memory/INDEX.md','''# Current ChatGPT source\\n+\\n+SonoField-FPGA: BLOCKED / CHAT_MEMORY_ACCESS_BLOCKED. Unique chat ID/URL UNKNOWN. No supported external ChatGPT-history reader is exposed by the current real tool catalog. Zero external messages imported; this cannot be marked COMPLETE. Current Codex interaction records are separate and PARTIAL. Existing source/import metadata is retained; no transcript or decision invented.\\n+\\n+[Source record](SonoField-FPGA.md) · [import requirements](CHAT_MEMORY_IMPORT_REQUIRED.md)\\n+''')\\n+\\n+original_state.update(workspace_path=original_state['workspace_path'],candidate_workspace_path=str(R),workspace_promotion_status='PENDING_USER_PATH_CONFIRMATION_AND_MAIN_MERGE',branch=BRANCH,current_branch=BRANCH,current_stage='AX7020_V5_WORKSPACE_MIGRATION_CANDIDATE',status='PROJECT_ACTIVE',current_model='UNKNOWN_CURRENT_RUNTIME_NOT_VERIFIED',model_provenance_basis='Historical records retain their original model provenance',codex_thread_id=os.environ.get('CODEX_THREAD_ID','UNKNOWN'),migration_base_commit=BASE,migration_phase='PHASE_2_TO_5_IN_PROGRESS',main_merge_approval='NOT_REQUESTED',organization_result='PENDING_VALIDATION',digital_validation='BASE_PASS_MIGRATED_PENDING',digital_evidence='v5/evidence/migration/20261009/base/summary.json',reproducibility='CLEAN_CLONE_PENDING',latest_context_checkpoint='CP-20261009-002',checkpoint_commit=None,checkpoint_status='DRAFT_PENDING_VALIDATION',last_remote_verified_source_commit=BASE,next_action='Finish all migration gates and submit concrete candidate Draft PR for user review',updated_at=NOW)\\n+for k in ['checkpoint_evidence_base_commit','git_sync_receipt','last_remote_verified_at','last_remote_verified_source_commit','verified_previous_workspaces','latest_bom_git_sync','latest_bom_review_status','checkpoint_commit_scope']:\\n+ original_state.pop(k,None)\\n+original_state['historical_readonly_board_evidence']='v5/evidence/board_bringup/20261009/RESULT.md'\\n+js('shared/PROJECT_STATE.json',original_state)\\n+js('shared/VERSION_STATE.json',{**original_versions,'upgrade_pending':False,'workspace_migration':True,'updated_at':NOW})\\n+put('shared/PROJECT_STATE.md',f'''# Current v5 state\\n+\\n+Same SONOFIELD_FPGA repository; v5 ACTIVE, v1/v2 FROZEN in historical snapshot, v3 paused private local draft, v4 absent; no v6. Candidate branch `{BRANCH}`, BASE `{BASE}`, clone `{R}`. Main merge and permanent workspace promotion pending. Machine-readable current authority is PROJECT_STATE.json.\\n+\\n+Digital BASE freshly reproduced, migrated/clean-clone evidence pending. Physical platform REVISE; board facts are historical read-only identification, not runtime validation. Current blocker table: BLOCKERS.md. Original sandbox preserved; local/private inventory not published. Hardware current truth: NU40C10T/unknownRX/formalAD7606B/independentupper-lowerpower/threeunreleasedPCBs. See migration hardware conflict disposition and current integration scope.\\n+''')\\n+put('shared/CURRENT_PLAN.md','''# Current v5 migration plan\\n+\\n+Phase0 reconciliation/inventory PASS; Phase1 independent cold-start BASE/OOC PASS. Phase2 fixed Git tree archive and active root extraction prepared. Phase3 current hardware/state conflict dispositions prepared. Phase4 output/path/search/CI isolation; Phase5 fresh migrated and second clean-clone gates; Phase6 candidate commits/push/Draft PR and user review. Phase6 merge/post-merge remote cold start waits for explicit user approval. Phase7 rollback plan and retained failure evidence apply throughout.\\n+\\n+After candidate acceptance stop migration optimization. Engineering next action remains obtain Rev3-matched PS/DDR/IO/clock/grade and running-image ownership/UART/BSP, then separately authorized safe no-load integration; independent ADC/power/safety review and exact TX/RX qualification precede native schematic/ERC and measured acoustic stages. This migration authorizes no board writes or manufacture.\\n+''')\\n+put('shared/ACCEPTANCE.md','''# Current v5 acceptance\\n+\\n+Migration scope preserves all inherited technical criteria. Required: MIG01–12 exact archive blob/mode/rawSHA256; private original protection; v5-only load/search; current facts;115/115Python and3696frames×3Icarus+1XSim; canonical trajectory/map/trap/ACK equality; all protocol/C/AXI/calibration/safety/serializer/golden gates; native Vivado2025.2 OOC/reopen/loaded source proof; second clean clone with new locked venv and full offline gates; consistent current docs and hardware no-operation boundary. Results: shared/migration/PORTABILITY_AND_REGRESSION.md.\\n+\\n+Keep calibration35dB thresholds: translation norm<0.1mm, angle norm<0.1deg, f0RMSE<80Hz, phaseRMSE<2deg. Keep lower-SNR failed/rejected records; never weaken thresholds. Signed1024×8 capture, two-bank reference constraints, full-map atomic commit/ACK/no overwrite, safety/timeout/error behavior and protocol/registers remain fixed. Canonical functional hashes ignore only explicitly nonfunctional timestamps/absolute-report headers. Formal ADC remains AD7606BBSTZ-RL; candidates require separate decision/approval.\\n+\\n+Candidate-only scope may be ACCEPT WITH LIMITATIONS after all executable migration gates. Formal migration requires user-approved merge and post-merge fresh remote clone; before that no claim main is migrated. Physical whole-platform remains REVISE: no full-board routed timing/XDC/PS platform/ARM BSP/realUART+AXI/ADC+driver/AFE/safety/electrical/thermal/trap/particle evidence. Historical read-only identification and OOC do not close physical gates. Native v5 schematic NOT_CREATED/ERC_NOT_RUN; electrical/manufacturing HOLD. Independent review remains pending.\\n+''')\\n+print('CANDIDATE_TREE_PREPARED',len(manifest['files']),manifest['bytes'],flush=True)\\n*** End Patch\"));\n"
AI-interaction-memory/tool-flow/T-20261009-004__prepcb.json:22:      "observable_excerpt": "[{\"type\": \"input_text\", \"text\": \"Script completed\\nWall time 2.0 seconds\\nOutput:\\n\"}, {\"type\": \"input_text\", \"text\": \"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 11463)\\nTotal output lines: 2\\n\\n{\\\"i\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"fulfilled\\\",\\\"value\\\":{\\\"chunk_id\\\":\\\"fa610c\\\",\\\"wall_time_seconds\\\":0.2172199,\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"original_token_count\\\":11076,\\\"output\\\":\\\"# SonoField-FPGA v5 — AX7020 / NU40C10T PCB 落地前全系统开发正式指令\\\\n\\\\n**执行对象：Codex 6.1 Sol · Extra High（模型选择由用户在 Codex 界面完成）**  \\\\n**指令日期：2026-10-09**  \\\\n**PROJECT_ID：`SONOFIELD_FPGA`；正式版本：`v5`；Repository：`https://github.com/loverlike1216/SonoField-FPGA.git`**  \\\\n**工具链：Vivado / Vitis 2025.2，Windows 优先 PowerShell 7 (`pwsh`)**  \\\\n**工作范围：PCB 制造/上板之前，尽可能完成真实可执行的 FPGA、PS、PL、协议、上位机、校准算法、接口、硬件候选设计及独立验证。**\\\\n\\\\n> **先阅读本文全部内容后执行。本文是用户当次目标与工程开发边界，不是对未发生硬件测试的完成证明。**\\\\n> **禁止**因本指令建立 v6；禁止擅自更换正式仓库、删除/重写 Git 历史、force push、修改冻结历史、直接生成/发布 Gerber 或购买器件。若新沙盒和 `history_old/` 尚在迁移中，应先确认当前仓库真实状态和迁移门禁，**不得抢先进行破坏性迁移**。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 1. User Goal / 必须达成的端到端路线\\\\n\\\\n建成一个基于 **ALINX AX7020，XC7Z020 速度等级 -2、工业温度等级 I（这两项由用户声明，正式芯片丝印/厂家证据仍需复核）** 的 128 路 40 kHz 超声双阵列控制平台：\\\\n\\\\n1. **中央 PCB ×1**：直接连接 AX7020 的两组 2×20 扩展头 J10/J11；中央板安装唯一的 8 通道同时采样 ADC、数据/时序接口、供电保护、环境参考 TMP117 和可选但推荐的 SHT45 湿度传感器。**中央板要求由 AX7020 扩展口供电**，必须先真实验证 J10/J11 电源引脚和剩余电流预算，否则停在设计待核验，不准通过回灌、电源偷接或未经批准的额外供电隐瞒不足。\\\\n2. **上阵列 PCB ×1、下阵列 PCB ×1**：尽量采用**同一套 PCB 设计/相同元件布局、不同板位标识与装配方向**；每片 8×8 的 NU40C10T 发射器，共 128 TX；每片四角 4 个接收器，共 8 RX（RX 精确 MPN 尚待选型，不能把 NU40C10T 当 RX 使用）。两阵列各有**自己的外置电源输入、eFuse/保险/监测/断电安全控制**，电源不通过 AX7020 传输。功率驱动、电平转换、串行寄存器尽量靠近本阵列。\\\\n3. PS/PL 上电后系统保持 **SAFE/OFF**。PS KEY1 长按确认安全预备；PL KEY1 长按触发稀疏几何自校准（设计见后）；任一失能、超温、通信错误、急停时双阵列切到安全状态。**机载按钮不是唯一急停措施**，必须有独立常闭急停和默认失能硬件路径。\\\\n4. 自校准阶段：按既定方向逐个激励**两条对角线及用户指定补充点**，从当前 TX 到**对侧四个 RX**收集波形，结合 3 个 TMP117 与必要的湿度/声速模型，拟合可辨识的阵列位姿、传输延迟、参考"
